Z||000000||Joe Torma||10-15-2001||07:50 PM||||Under the cover of darkness, I drove my car.  It has no dash, or guages, or side mirrors for that matter...I don't care, I'll risk the ticket(s)!<P>Amazing.  The 3400 revs up so quick and the car feels SO light(having no interior helps) it's incredible.  IT'S QUICK.  Like SICK QUICK.<P>Clutch action sucks for some reason, and the rear seems twitchy(quickie alignment job last night).  I also have lots of work to do programming the engine control system I'm sure 'cause it stalls when I let off the gas in neutral from high rpms.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Joe happy.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig1.gif">  <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A>||||reg||1
